  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "雌單獨居，歸其本巢。毛羽憔悴，志如死灰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:06ecf5ecf7f0641b21786243176477f5a1dd40fb87d494306e510b946a9e0185",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4a17e0b486a7f5fc17646d6bda421cc8055c387be124f34e993b44227cd7bf88"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "小窗多明，道里利通。仁賢君子，國安不僵。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f37f235f4ef8d88b40a03d3975a0d455c14a6d88c690a637ac1fc98e99eea697",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ab0f5e2d92a07a0338a6bc968781fd087c07798f945e3ce141fbf04f2fe1d232"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "心惡來恠，衝衝何懼。顏淵子騫，尼父聖誨。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6bae49ffd5ab9d9a4506bbac924eba3883bf0a8789e5cfb34ee0481b725473f8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9c503f69e61be65c2ba46f0628e88c7211b7b2716d8e61f4dbc696ae2128dff9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "鳥鳴呼子，哺以酒脯。高棲水起，來歸其母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9ee97dab5e354857a4119423acf47087eb27448c6d0e891d97034d0133e262a9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d7d9b78e7531aa606a58dc392b8c5b15fee06bd0d516bd3d14a7bad95040a47d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "國馬生角，陰孽萌作。變易常服，君失于宅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a9da3eb5d030fb960e7fe2c2d64d74e7a37a1345885b46b39fc40e67aab10553",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:09b548d1e6fac24fe63c336b983dfd57a0fd3f8ca856f87124aacaca77af25e6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "入年多悔，耕石不富。衡門屢空，使士失意。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:61e0b0d2cc48fdabe1f168697ec30b7719bf913ff4d1f0219dd5fa06e9112dda",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:21773cae1c8da4925d1dc2957e72a1bb3f5dbead3ea73a023611c3e04736ca57"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "諸孺行賈，遠涉山阻。與旅為市，不危不殆。利得十倍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:58eedad92024ca5133ad8bc6ee258f4d742671900d1f879a18098b0f6a19019c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f76c001a10ee6f2fd66114568fd66e4a266d37af2b32026e5ee38e1a015fade7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "梁破橋壞，水深多畏。陳鄭之間，絕不得前。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9e8932744511468905a8ea9a5a4c424da637f75c359295e64c6af8ae99dedd13",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8d292c3c308c7eeac83d52606e39ccfba3a776361fb818525e9bb9408c2e7996"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "雙鳧俱飛，以歸稻池。經涉萑澤，為矢所傷。損我胸臆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f9cdc1e48ef823077ffa3cf01bfc196c5a996f837e4da0d43fcf447cbe031d25",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:09b637cad99b86c104bb02c789cecc9c3f187bc41377eeb52287840cb9b26b24"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "謾誕不成，佶梁滅文。許人買牛，三夫爭之。失利後時，公孫懷憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c37d29b22bff586a0e3c89697966c907c8c9f400bd82e3f2e2a72602850dc8ac",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9f12bb34daa6d987bb856322b108232dd13eb918e16eb083666e2ffd337643fa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "南國饑凶，民食糟糠。少子困捕，利無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:79a4f12b18bf67ffdb8a86d51636d8b0a339fe0d79a42f8479c1bc908d97c000",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1834dc53a66338a0a39e8270028167c26bb813ffedec2405bd804e80f333eedc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "狗吠非主，狼虎夜擾。驚我東西，不為家咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:63fc2cfc31c874d51388eaf2503e0ba280ad64f6181df6964976b64a2348073d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d3a8545bb38dc58e3d8388dec2313dce089c4f79aa661c5fb81a622036f1822c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "望龍無目，不見手足。入水求玉，失其所欲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fd361ab973a30f29dc37e5b43450cd3d90899bbd5f0de0f7088a8e5061cbc916",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1429c7a1ae3f7ee63596da51716fecb4a6d1353fa2c08360c66d0c0035ebb222"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "以鹿為馬，欺誤其主。聞言不信，三口為咎。黃龍三子，中樂不殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:67fb63eb0d8d6343dd3e51d45b0a634cbd2f662bef7df266d1273cac1855a21e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cf3b04993e2cff204da2534ba1872374744b76d56c381aaa27ae0308f0b74da1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "養幼新婚，未能出門。登宋望齊，不見太師。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0a21df94abcc3898a2ca9f1f8df068a4aaf5a0a4be010dde45dcac13e9095e26",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cee13eebffeea3574ddfda1bfac1396e1267049e8fec5dd00fdb57f4b6e8789d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "王孫貴子，相與為友。明允篤誠，升擢薦舉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:91f899a8d3486c0a4dfcfed078deea16bebe5240831faba353e11d9a40b0cbe0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:416a7013a85ea68fdc2fea0c3ca966ffc16b999a0d018a5fffd8c044fbe8db45"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "山水暴怒，壞梁折柱。稽旅難行，留連愁苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f6b5d39cf4f1e64c17653f1765fec70108837bad5b67029ed41fe969cfa713b9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:50539eb6f1339ae5e27d984eabe7da32cf876c01de83b6212bd3826fca8f4f55"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "鸇鳩徙巢，西至平州。遭逢雷電，碎我苕蘆。室家飢寒，思吾故初。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cfdee4973f319d37db781480408fd7e28bdcce787959ee7b3e4b694441da757b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:899553e0a65d883f6907dbd2403c6c4fd34d5b455fb3b339db3c2c1d7bad55dd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "登高傷軸，土阪棄粟。販鹽不利，市賈折角。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ee09134af627c2d5ecbe77f3e69118822b1a0a6d6a23d1a6b94e55381c1b187d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:57c6e73b0d32e980540cebc60fc4e2636fe13acda79b48a8e8416ebd11ae7d92"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "祝鮀王孫，能事鬼神。節用綏民，衛國以存。眉壽多年。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:429dac82531593138e8703a206d1ed8fd930b7c0a7858995260f064faecd8a25",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4c4ed8fecb8786f7da47f8c589811a5d2a0012dce45a763171f939eb5537cc54"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "九里十山，道卻峻難。牛馬不前，復反來還。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6a30656b13412f721f6f1b3e1cb3f81737ac9e136ebcfe9dd4ebc7bf6cc0bf68",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:69717662c9141388039503261c64795f93ff4819e879fefa4a34f231a49e2be7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "枯樹不花，空淵無魚。舊鳥飛翔，利棄我去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:024f076cdc55902b8b335b73a0ea5af8b624bb27207fa0ffd66f52fd6664afd1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:88ef39c72db997d83d17557e33c2922362aac70b746a9cbd90df82aa3139dc97"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "雄狐綏遺，登山崔嵬。昭告顯功，大福允興。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:96b5f734d739fe6d65988419534790e717fbcadaa1cb4b832679fbfaa1ee65a4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:93c77005480b5984f4b457adedf89ed77e2a12689c01815f005f3b316952a7ef"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "啞啞笑言，與歡飲酒。長樂行觴，千秋起舞。拜受大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:978900e5638066c4de776639e051f13066aa6feb7e69995aba943b47f94af62e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d8b92d0bbf6f342721681a43cc4b2fcb8c89ad35896975f98914fc5bf034d145"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "大推破轂，長舌亂國。床笫之言，三世不安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:88e3d24eb5382c3e642ccd6eccd6d1c58985acfc69a6695cdb149dd804b13036",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0df8ae341ddd1937a5c05034680382746b0f412125b775462af015161bcb6de8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "男女合室，三姓同食。婚姻孔云，宜我孝孫。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5d9b382a95f5778e5832107196c3c51759cc5a05700e68d1acb20e142b7f3e08",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b2337d804248578a7817a15b6633a0162d5a2de07f296dc8dcbf26bb56d4cfd1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "千仞之牆，不得入門。金籠銕疏，利以避兵。欲上南阪，軸方不轉，還車復反。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:98001e50cffc9b05c1c0e4a80f1c4509ccde789cdba61723f36e80c3f00c5645",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:94ae6e7277fe72281c97e277136c6bab6db2606adc07797845c5e81ba792f05f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "華言風語，自相詿誤。終無凶事，安寧如故。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2832dbbc30856e6f2c1c61662401460bec33b87786acd3a2c9fb0b0c6ebfc2eb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:886e787a4c294c291a9bf0b7fe83c4d65db448223456069460240aa2cda1ce04"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "汎汎柏舟，流行不休。耽耽寐寐，公懷大憂。仁不遇時，退隱窮居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:55bb6f9e99247123f0e040086c60735f09a4f65789398de0ecb1cb1228db4d42",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dedf61139ccbec0d8279f77b4fccfc30f5aa666af702436ac13a18e0fe04cf46"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "大尾小頭，重不可搖。上弱下強，陰制其雄。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b23506cb50b697f70dca6f46ac1207ec080448364ec779d290ca80de52ac2ebc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7903fc6530329cbf624b838d8f586fa720c85b5b8ceec1fd6ade9724200dba1f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "一身三口，語無所主。東西南北，迷惑失道。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2ce49f4d5543d2f4628ab06cce0e7d5c6cc6daa890681cccc30069e3b6b8558d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bdc5a66177a549a6233db3b94dbe15644ec2b40203c0c8b38ddcf2947e84c5b6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "南行求福，與喜相得。封受上賞，鼎足輔國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7bfa843d7c9d97ae22ea1cb181328ccd0d6f65a1814e5bd79ef226685ba1d2f5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:516bcb6a6f07bc259aa57e6ad3a56feee422ddfafd8dcca71dfb665993af1d06"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "過時不歸，雌雄苦悲。徘徊外國，與母分離。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:59bed8ab5f6f6e9219321bd702f8a32fe635fc274a0f770b33080094722e35e0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dd7ce76f843f6e834c8ad5da389388c8ff7a74391018c5af6e886ee21bfcfaf2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "堯舜在國，陰陽和德。涿聚衣裳，晉人無殃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:731d688a14c9bb7614dd7a604bf70c9beecaf6f326212a82f7241bd30f7feb14",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d6898110505c8451119b018cd8e35863520175e0c75791817b0c448ddf2d850b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "周公之隆，越裳夷通。疾病多祟，鬼哭其公。狼子野心，客宿不同。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a7de3ee35c01b58c28ecb258a5d7a704e544ebacf65fd1fde645e35675b680a0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7573e88f5e729b9938ff558d222975ef696de0c1d86aeee58f5271f19595a9a8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "申酉脫服，牛馬休息。君子以安，勞者得懽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:29cdaa285e46188bf1e2dfdec3a275af2e4c5b2112a761a55e16ac06d4f352ae",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3744c097ddd1a0b45ebe66479461f6e74202c9c6b5cb4e7ae523a6d27bc3c080"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "凱風無母，何恃何怙。幼孤弱子，為人所苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c6c64380d9b4d2f10735e2b9c80f404191304cd992c66cbd50124219ab4d70c6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e79ffbbb7a1aff606cc3584a0072ced496283edcccb5cd21682573fa64aed00b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "出門上堂，從容牖房。不失其常，天牢地戶。勞者憂苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f346d8327c48e55b69f6705c4b1fe6b55feff006ab97d968039b8cd6003b249e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:35236feb66bc14a8bd7cb86f52f3e9106e7611e17915d28a299aba14bb607b06"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "天厭周德，命與南國。以禮靜民，兵革休息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8ecd811a7fb2985ee84e0d371b0a16f3b23ef24d5a9ad4b387e8995788fe7d16",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0862ff1986db28f6eb52a31d66ef11e8b2f61cca9e9e89bd63aeb2120ce24f66"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "堂桑折衡，佐鬥者傷。暴臣反國，良臣被殃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4165db9857add3194691bd6987df3b1aa1249dd767594d49219913b0ccafb511",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:03230016be40e705d4d15a94de97b7c8de739c48ebf4e704652834025c9540a9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "合歡之國，嘉喜我福。東岳西山，朝齊成思。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6d0fe5f04ae63e0764736c62097738b4c82035201b47badc31fb2fef8f127eaf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2586aa119e145e79afdb28a3fd37aa121f73f7b51d9fb75fdfa02493c236a13e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "耕石不生，棄禮無名。縫衣失針，襦褲不成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c44c939760c16b70e47b782c48ae12d12507d5949b5c2497516bae044260050a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3fa6aaca63734a22caf3ab3f763df173bb80d3397d989f4760b3b073d99d7c1e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "聾瞢闇盲，跛倚不行。坐戶孚骸，身被大災。困其多憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fb80b1f4e55a71ded58b03b8ab720b8c6d0c5ce59aa3233f768448eb583749c2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b0fe13e85cb726f22836bff3983224d8d949b918667a898313466730eb5cdab3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "生長太平，仁政流行。四方歸德，社稷康榮。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e29f953716e0d48b5f192f9093d33c9d7321df07c43e2638a6b6aa4a70353f77",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3bd2f24b30b79577293a923128c9d9f334ece4691ae558857416674d81921a35"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "桀跖並處，民人愁苦。捕兵荷糧，戰於齊魯。合巹得牢，姬姜並居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d242f4124ba16b899df72febe0eae4b9fdf9a847811772f12128db40c54dcd33",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:37d36eef04a34bc44ed6e93cff6ad25425e9c031aea78831ebc375aec1b368e1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "南與凶俱，破車失襦。西行無褲，亡其寶賂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0c381558ddaec582ea9d3253ea180cc7694680ed36d8a4c6d18a4cc1d4ebc23b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:56690f74d969d75bd357495613a9903c4a9ca22563e20bea7c9e4cad6f6d9e3f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "空曹注器，豚彘不至。張弓祝雞，雄父飛去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7726d5d196f292973d51c69909aa3fc4257c74dd69d2c021d865c85addf89138",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8fd6c805317a98af948f66268061e49eff5726edcb72204c65250a96bf1ff457"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "望尚阿衡，太宰周公。藩屏湯武，立為王侯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3e8fcb45b124f5323e49c9daa71cf66455eab8e2ba55c1c72c1dc8f8afdf0d1d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7839bd32138a6fcd29174b12663a03f7d8c68aa505f5965a59692216065aafba"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "朝鮮之地，姬伯所保。宜家宜人，業處子孫。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7b3409293b8052749e5fbe44644f3e895e25dcd55765d0f2dd095b44b96732b4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:400e321a9b07c76e0bbeffc1870e71750ef8402f4b07672932b1eaa5133b5537"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "息憂解笑，故貧今富。載樂履善，與福俱憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:714bad5b2c334e697bdd41891518e598219d2b32e5dbfb5941c62ba76f313a05",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f7a589764b01623224c853150063d3f7e9fda6b4dea5aa5f5bccc5f93515e754"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "叔迎伯兄，遇巷在陽。君子季姬，並坐鼓簧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2bd394886c396f7f4e1dd7b60602ec40eb2128e863fc841f4c34e3ba6a752ff4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b54ae790ce30462911aced5573a528c286cd3b11a1e96af8b3d55463f7a759a2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "順風縱火，艾芝俱亡。三官集房，一子中傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3630323b892663f9f7ced57e12386cf4b759a4cdfd7cf09d9fd6e9c9f47f4177",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:874b13bf630b303b83dc37abc65c92ea455fab633f2e884710c55b2c312e4bc1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "駕車八里，求鮮魴鯉。非吾肆居，自令失布。君子所在，安無危殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fcc1c69d8b6770a8c996179979e8cbbd5e2d2c2eae547738dbc500835adfc024",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4c1ce699c84518e8ac8c1ddc50247c7b6dd706eedb230f65b829aa0d64078eec"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "拔劍傷手，見敵不起。良臣無佐，困辱為苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b37ee644bb4a796d3e91f2dd42c9d713f136282e07d337e61d9069e38044e0a8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5df3463c5558dc805afd0a29ea7b058ffd7083ebd39eb1e8d13fa7796fe6e017"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "亂君之門，佐鬥傷跟。營私貪祿，身為悔殘。東下泰山，見我所歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6db782299692e3e3d7509c70ff0455e5a0990916dd6ff1503e5839c9628475d7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3412fca94a96dd8051d1e055c4aa5f6915a1b633e7467bcd6ff809726a4889ab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "慈母望子，遙思不已。久客外野，使我心苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a318af50b12c9a1371cd724cb5e89c3f806bed1597a50def6a2c949515551301",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:adee7460b3b75b3960c625facb9a663f608535efa8dbeeca1cf5032bca0b0838"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "魴生淮郤，一轉為百。周流四海，無有患惡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3884c2a72fdc9f2df9755072a7328c5238a2e956042bd082a1bf3458f292767d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:70f253e8a2aa13544f7aa54adf323dcba741ddc9d54c2d4ece38c9da89b9647a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "甘露醴泉，太平機關。仁德感應，歲樂民安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:31e23dfad25cb9878709b31e07cb0d3d3f9e8b4d2c328fd752ffd6915a9a092f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3470f5fbb8955747676dfa44a292e438454755f30e88f79f7bf02df9d64cbe92"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "采薇出車，魚麗思初。上下役急，君子免憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f6a716588f076df0846d541421cdbebc050d1390656a991c60ed029c8089acd4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7c105a106c4bb49fb6a22afe96d457afc8ced032064fdacf9995ac556ea98b81"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "豕生魚魴，鼠舞庭堂。雄佞施毒，上下昏荒。君失其邦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ee67c9577a406151d2326d45e55d2b25187f6de824e993b1103405a34975447e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d82d6e8b82946552ac9c7ce81c5c0fa10d493eaa322bf291f2523f3ff750907b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "三頭六目，道畏難宿。寒苦之國，利不可得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f6a78cb449f7d3302130683961804685b9b60db523a3f491761bdb2c76a5f187",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ca8a300d4add756cd60dfdf21e523704a05975ae934b9f49f9b132c1ed793c33"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "燕雀御茅，以生孚乳。昆弟六人，懽好孝悌。各同心願，和悅相樂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:005e2958e5748765e596a7c910e7c0e2ed24b609ae35b8645667c4dd87cb819b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4bd3a2326c6bbc66e0075060910ffdabbed43ce1e7f80d9bc73465e3e7dd72fd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "文君德義，仁聖致福。年無胎夭，國富民實。臥者在室，曾累益息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d8fe8bfa237565edd4de4a0b2afb68a4004d571ef7aa29cf1e638cf1faa5ac3e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c5c53ddacbc016651179784f0d2646ae91fae2eb3b6dace3791884f0b79f1e2e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 31,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "秋梁未成，無以至陳。水深難涉，使我不前。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:81a97421d2f2ab74d73efdb52d146c0b647ac4f7fc5d0011d05eb55d62f1312a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8a634fbea8a6a3123607acf4ce9f05ded12b3b34974287389fd4500ecd79fa56"
    }
  ]
}
